    "user": "[2023 spring ms applied — problem 2]\n\nModel $y_i = \\beta_0 + x_i\\beta_1 + \\varepsilon_i$, $\\varepsilon_i \\sim N(0,\\sigma^2)$, with data $X = (-5,-3,0,2,1)$, $Y = (-2,1,4,6,3)$. (1) Estimate $\\beta_0, \\beta_1$ and draw the scatterplot with fitted line. (2) Compute fitted values $\\hat y_i$. (3) Compute residuals and draw the residual plot. (4) Compute $R^2$.",
